loop 1 when k =1, x = 1 ,  a[[1]] <- 1
loop 2 when k =1, x = 2 ,  a[[1]] <- 2
..
..
loop 24 when k =1, x = 24 ,  a[[1]] <- 24
..
..
Loop from 1 to 23 are meaningless(replace by a[[1]] <- 24)

FYR:
kx <- vector("list", length = 61)
for(k in c(1:61)){
  for(x in c(1:24)){    kx[[k]][[x]] <- paste(k,x,sep='_')    }
